WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
After registration, you will get login credentials to your registered email ID.

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:07.680
You will be receiving welcome to launched global email and open it.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:14.200
You will be receiving this email from credentials at learn.launchglobal.in if not check in spam folder.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:20.280
Now click on login here. Now you will reach to this interface and click on email option.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:24.920
Go back to your email and here launch head already provided username and password.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.800
Copy them and pass to this interface and click on sign in.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:34.000
After sign in, you will reach to this interface where you can able to see the course

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.920
which you have enrolled for. In case if you will not able to access the course,

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.540
then you need to clear the pending amount according to your opted domain.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:46.880
After that click on the domain, we'll reach to this page and now click on start lecture.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:49.540
Now you can access the lecture videos in this page.

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.360
Make sure after finishing the video, click on mark video as finish.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.100
And here you can access the further lecture videos.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:59.500
This was about recorded videos. Now we will go to live classes.

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:03.960
After login, the dashboard will display the classes scheduled for today.

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:06.420
Click on it and you will reach to this interface.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.580
Once the mentor starts the session, the class will begin.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.420
Here you will can watch previous class recording.

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:14.740
You can also use this chat box also.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:18.380
You'll receive three email notifications before your class begins.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.460
The first notification will be sent to you one day prior to the start of the class.

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:26.700
The second notification will be sent six hours prior to the start of the class.

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:31.060
The third notification will be sent 30 minutes prior to the start of the class.

